        "# H3 Music Video\n\n1. **Load the song** \u2192 `audio` of the **H3 Music Video Writer** (and `replace_audio` of H3 Scenes Join, so the finished video carries the original track).\n2. The writer cuts the song into 5\u201315 s pieces on the music (timed lyrics make cuts land before lines), writes one scene per piece with `<Audio 1>` = that piece, and emits matching lists: `scenes` \u2192 prompt, `lengths` \u2192 length (frame counts on H3's grid), `audio_segments` \u2192 `ref_audio_1`.\n3. The H3 video node runs once per piece; **H3 Scenes Join** stitches the clips and puts the song back under them.\n\nPut lyrics with timestamps (`[0:12] line`) for exact lip-sync; a custom performer + wardrobe comes from the H3 Characters node (\u270f\ufe0f custom). Connect reference images (the performer's face) to the writer's `image_1..` and they reach the video node and the preview thumbnails."
      ],
      "title": "How this works",
      "color": "#222",
      "bgcolor": "#000"
    },
